---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import DraftNotice from '../components/DraftNotice.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How the LCR Labs website handles data, and where each application's own privacy behaviour is described."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
        <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
      </header>

      <div class="prose">
        <DraftNotice
          action="This describes the site as it is currently built. It is a scaffold, not a reviewed GDPR/DSGVO privacy policy, and needs legal review — plus the hosting details below — before publication."
        >
          <ul>
            <li>Confirm the hosting provider and its data-processing terms</li>
            <li>Confirm what the host logs, for how long, and on what legal basis</li>
            <li>Add the responsible party and contact address (see the imprint)</li>
            <li>Add the standard data-subject rights section in German</li>
            <li>Have the finished text reviewed against DSGVO requirements</li>
          </ul>
        </DraftNotice>

        <h2>What this website does</h2>
        <p>
          This site is a set of static pages. It has no accounts, no login, no shop, no
          comment system and no forms. It does not process payments and does not deliver
          software.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
        <p>
          The site sets no cookies and includes no analytics, advertising or session-replay
          scripts. There is no tracking pixel and no third-party embed.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you use the appearance switch in the header, your choice is stored in your own
          browser’s local storage under the key <code>lcr-theme</code>. It never leaves your
          device and is not readable by LCR Labs.
        </p>

        <h2>Fonts and assets</h2>
        <p>
          All images and styles are served from this site. No web fonts are downloaded — the
          site uses the typefaces already installed on your system — so no font service
          receives your IP address.
        </p>

        <h2>Server logs</h2>
        <p>
          The site is served by a hosting provider, which may record technical access data
          such as IP address, time of request, requested page and user agent for the purpose
          of delivering the site securely.
        </p>
        <p class="placeholder">
          Hosting provider, retention period and legal basis: to be confirmed.
        </p>

        <h2>Links to Setapp</h2>
        <p>
          Product pages link to Setapp, where LCR Labs applications are distributed. Following
          such a link takes you to a service operated by another company, under its own privacy
          policy. LCR Labs receives no personal data about you from those links.
        </p>

        <h2>Privacy inside the applications</h2>
        <p>
          This notice covers the website only. Each application’s own data handling is
          described on its product page and in the app itself; the shared intent across all
          LCR Labs software is that personal data stays on your Mac.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          The responsible party and contact details are listed in the
          <a href="/imprint/">imprint</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .head {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .head h1 {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  .placeholder {
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
